of the Mulan Hunting Ground.

22
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:22,120
Even the direction of the shelves
is mocking that

23
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:22,910
Zhou Yan died in

24
00:02:22,910 --> 00:02:26,110
the second lunar month,
when all things come back to life.

25
00:02:35,710 --> 00:02:36,400
This is

26
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:39,260
the royal secret kept on
the Hare shelf in Section A.

27
