[Imperial Astronomical Bureau’s Record
of Celestial Anomalies]

30
00:03:18,140 --> 00:03:24,060
[9th day of the 2nd lunar month
in the 20th year of Hongyun]

31
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,150
In the suburbs of
the capital's Tianhuang City,

32
00:03:20,150 --> 00:03:21,079
at Mulan Hunting Ground.

33
00:03:21,079 --> 00:03:23,520
On the 9th day of the 2nd lunar month
in the 20th year of Hongyun,

34
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,430
in the third solar term,

35
00:03:24,430 --> 00:03:28,130
Fourth Prince Zhou Yan
died in a mountain fire

36
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:30,680
during a spring hunt.

37
00:03:30,530 --> 00:03:31,260
[9th day of the 2nd lunar month
in the 20th year of Hongyun]

38
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:05,280
I want to go home!

39
00:04:05,470 --> 00:04:08,180
Brother, where are you?

40
00:04:08,470 --> 00:04:13,030
I want to go home! I want to go home!

41
00:04:14,030 --> 00:04:16,390
I want to go home!

42
00:04:17,870 --> 00:04:20,750
I want to go home!

43
00:04:21,310 --> 00:04:22,360
Who are you?

44
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:24,560
I want to go home!

45
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,390
How dare you!

46
00:04:25,430 --> 00:04:27,240
Your robe is embroidered
with dragon patterns.

47
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,070
Don't you know

48
00:04:28,070 --> 00:04:29,430
this is a crime of overstepping?

49
00:04:29,430 --> 00:04:31,560
I didn't want to wear this.

50
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:34,159
Someone put it on me.

51
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,680
Stop crying.

52
00:04:44,310 --> 00:04:45,870
Are you lost?

53
00:04:47,830 --> 00:04:50,040
I am the Fourth Prince
of the current dynasty, Zhou Yan.

54
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:52,380
I can ask my father to send you home.

55
00:04:52,870 --> 00:04:54,080
Really?

56
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:59,060
My father wove this for me.

57
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,250
You can play with it.

58
00:05:01,430 --> 00:05:02,240
Take it.

59
00:05:14,310 --> 00:05:15,240
Stop crying.

60
00:06:56,510 --> 00:06:57,480
Who are you?

61
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:03,280
Who are you?

62
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:14,940
As his father, I was overcome with grief.

63
00:07:14,940 --> 00:07:18,060
I suspended court for 3 days
to keep vigil for my beloved son.

64
00:07:18,060 --> 00:07:21,190
Following public opinion,
I bestowed upon my fourth son

65
00:07:21,630 --> 00:07:23,830
the posthumous title of Prince Qihuai.

66
00:07:26,330 --> 00:07:27,770
In the end, a prince

67
00:07:28,710 --> 00:07:30,710
was not as important as your empire.

68
00:07:34,510 --> 00:07:35,750
In your heart,

69
00:07:37,070 --> 00:07:37,870
have you ever

70
00:07:37,870 --> 00:07:39,560
truly felt heartache for me?

71
00:07:51,270 --> 00:07:52,360
The Fourth Prince

72
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:57,000
died in a mountain fire
during the spring hunt.

73
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,950
If I can find

74
00:08:03,750 --> 00:08:04,510
the cases related to

75
00:08:04,510 --> 00:08:06,370
missing children from that year,

76
00:08:06,950 --> 00:08:08,430
I might find a clue.

77
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:18,570
[Criminal Investigation Cases]

78
00:08:33,289 --> 00:08:34,600
[Local Customs] [Pharmacology]
[Reconstruction of Lost Texts]

79
00:08:34,690 --> 00:08:35,750
[Wind]

80
00:09:15,570 --> 00:09:16,880
[Case File on the Disappearance
of the Shen Family of Four]

81
00:09:18,780 --> 00:09:20,810
[Case File on the Disappearance
of the Shen Family of Four]

82
00:09:28,110 --> 00:09:29,510
[Detailed Record from
the Divine Constable Bureau]

83
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:35,060
[Cellar: 200 jin of radishes stored
for winter, stacked in a square pile]

84
00:09:35,130 --> 00:09:36,130
[Investigation Report
on the Shen Residence]

85
00:09:41,510 --> 00:09:44,240
On the 8th day of the 2nd lunar month
in the 20th year of Hongyun,

86
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,910
in Yeqiao Town,
on the outskirts of the capital,

87
00:09:45,910 --> 00:09:47,510
scholar Shen Baoquan

88
00:09:47,510 --> 00:09:49,310
and his family of 4 went missing.

89
00:09:49,960 --> 00:09:51,080
Apart from two

90
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:52,750
spurts of blood at the scene,

91
00:09:52,910 --> 00:09:54,240
there were no clues.

92
00:09:54,810 --> 00:09:56,410
This case remains unsolved.

93
00:10:01,330 --> 00:10:02,720
Missing persons:

94
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:04,800
Shen Baoquan, 31 years old.

95
00:10:04,850 --> 00:10:06,830
Shen Jing'an, 11 years old.

96
00:10:07,570 --> 00:10:10,090
Shen Lan, 8 years old...

97
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:14,140
The 8th day of the second lunar month.

98
00:10:15,270 --> 00:10:18,070
The day before the events at
Mulan Hunting Ground.

99
00:10:22,750 --> 00:10:25,270
Shen Lan, 8 years old.

100
00:10:27,510 --> 00:10:29,570
The 8th day of the second lunar month.

101
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:32,880
The day before the events at
Mulan Hunting Ground.

102
00:10:54,510 --> 00:10:54,870
[Divine Constable, Qingyang]

103
00:11:46,630 --> 00:11:48,080
That is the God of Lies,

104
00:11:48,360 --> 00:11:49,150
Qipi.

105
00:11:50,150 --> 00:11:51,720
It has no eyes or nose,

106
00:11:51,800 --> 00:11:53,730
[God of Lies, Qipi]

107
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:54,240
only a mouth that distorts the truth

108
00:11:54,510 --> 00:11:56,240
and deceives people's hearts.

109
00:11:59,440 --> 00:12:00,510
Chief.

110
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:03,270
Why are you here?

111
00:12:03,750 --> 00:12:05,200
It's almost midnight.

112
00:12:05,270 --> 00:12:06,670
You were in there for a long time,

113
00:12:06,670 --> 00:12:08,670
so I thought I'd come and take a look.

114
00:12:09,910 --> 00:12:11,670
As expected, nothing escapes

115
00:12:11,910 --> 00:12:13,390
the Chief's eyes.

116
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:18,550
Tianshu Pavilion is really too big.

117
00:12:18,630 --> 00:12:21,030
I accidentally lost track of time.

118
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:25,270
To linger like this,

119
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,790
you must have found something

120
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:29,510
interesting to you.

121
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:35,420
I originally thought that

122
00:12:35,550 --> 00:12:36,590
Tianshu Pavilion

123
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:38,630
was only used to store archives.

124
00:12:38,870 --> 00:12:39,870
I didn't expect

125
00:12:40,910 --> 00:12:41,720
there to be

126
00:12:41,720 --> 00:12:43,450
such a magnificent place here.

127
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,910
I am but a layman.

128
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:47,510
Despite studying them for a long while,

129
00:12:47,510 --> 00:12:49,040
I still couldn't figure out

130
00:12:49,270 --> 00:12:50,630
what was so profound

131
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:52,360
about these god murals.

132
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:54,840
If, as the Chief just said,

133
00:12:55,630 --> 00:12:57,550
Qipi represents lies,

134
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,120
then

135
00:12:59,150 --> 00:13:00,790
what do the other gods

136
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:02,720
represent?

137
00:13:03,550 --> 00:13:04,720
Chief,

138
00:13:05,150 --> 00:13:07,870
could you please enlighten me?

139
00:13:12,030 --> 00:13:13,080
This is Kelu,

140
00:13:13,670 --> 00:13:15,630
and this is Rangnan.

141
00:13:16,070 --> 00:13:19,750
They respectively oversee the Immortality
and Prophecy of all beings.

142
00:13:19,750 --> 00:13:20,550
Kelu?

143
00:13:21,870 --> 00:13:23,480
Is it the God Kelu that Wen Nansheng

144
00:13:23,480 --> 00:13:24,480
mentioned?

145
00:13:25,630 --> 00:13:26,440
Qipi

146
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:29,200
represents lies.

147
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:34,240
Haiqu is in charge of hatred.

148
00:13:34,100 --> 00:13:35,360
[God of Hatred, Haiqu]

149
00:13:36,030 --> 00:13:38,080
Qiuyu is the God of Calamity.

150
00:13:36,370 --> 00:13:38,330
[God of Calamity, Qiuyu]

151
00:13:38,870 --> 00:13:40,390
And this last one,

152
00:13:41,240 --> 00:13:42,080
Hanluo,

153
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:45,910
represents death.

154
00:13:46,310 --> 00:13:49,050
[God of Death, Hanluo]

155
00:13:49,630 --> 00:13:51,270
Are these all murals

156
00:13:51,270 --> 00:13:52,730
of the ancient Liluo Sect?

157
00:13:53,630 --> 00:13:54,720
But why are they here

158
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:56,920
in the secret room of Tianshu Pavilion?

159
00:13:58,150 --> 00:13:59,390
These murals

160
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:01,600
look really strange.

161
00:14:02,360 --> 00:14:03,270
They really don't look like

162
00:14:03,270 --> 00:14:04,870
things from our Shi Dynasty.

163
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,030
Chief,

164
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:08,270
may I know why you kept them

165
00:14:08,670 --> 00:14:10,870
in the secret room of Tianshu Pavilion?

166
00:14:11,910 --> 00:14:12,910
These are indeed

167
00:14:13,440 --> 00:14:15,270
not products of our Shi Dynasty.

168
00:14:16,270 --> 00:14:17,720
The reason they are sealed in

169
00:14:17,720 --> 00:14:19,670
the deepest part of Tianshu Pavilion

170
00:14:19,670 --> 00:14:20,600
is that

171
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:25,270
these things are highly ominous.

172
00:14:26,030 --> 00:14:26,910
Seeing them,

173
00:14:27,750 --> 00:14:28,960
you will understand

174
00:14:29,750 --> 00:14:30,960
where all the

175
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:32,360
pain and sin in this world

176
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,480
come from.

177
00:14:37,090 --> 00:14:38,280
Are these gods

178
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:41,150
actually the source of all pain

179
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:43,630
and sin in the world?

180
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,380
You must remember.

181
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:52,030
Even the closest people around you

182
00:14:52,910 --> 00:14:54,600
may not be what you see

183
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:56,550
with your own eyes.

184
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:04,570
I will keep the Chief's teachings in mind.

185
00:15:27,580 --> 00:15:30,910
[Yeqiao Town, Outskirts of Tianhuang City]

186
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:30,790
Miss.

187
00:16:31,030 --> 00:16:32,470
It's hot. Have some herbal tea.

188
00:16:32,470 --> 00:16:33,150
Take a look.

189
00:16:34,510 --> 00:16:35,510
It cools you down.

190
00:16:35,670 --> 00:16:36,480
Aunt Wang.

191
00:16:36,930 --> 00:16:37,910
Did you just make this?

192
00:16:37,910 --> 00:16:39,840
Yes, it's freshly woven.

193
00:16:40,120 --> 00:16:41,080
Excuse me, sir.

194
00:16:41,550 --> 00:16:42,870
May I ask

195
00:16:43,270 --> 00:16:45,080
how to get to this address?

196
00:16:43,580 --> 00:16:45,320
[List of Missing Persons]

197
00:16:46,550 --> 00:16:47,630
The Shen family?

198
00:16:47,670 --> 00:16:49,130
It's the courtyard ahead.

199
00:16:50,910 --> 00:16:52,780
[Noodles]

200
00:16:51,750 --> 00:16:52,550
Thank you.

201
00:16:52,630 --> 00:16:53,440
Okay.

202
00:16:56,030 --> 00:16:56,890
Is anyone here?

203
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,480
Is anyone home?

204
00:17:10,720 --> 00:17:11,550
Meng Rui?

205
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:13,920
Why is it you?

206
00:17:14,310 --> 00:17:15,270
This is my house.

207
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:19,740
This is your house?

208
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:27,920
Of course I know this is your house.

209
00:17:28,270 --> 00:17:29,800
I came here looking for you.

210
00:17:30,030 --> 00:17:30,880
I thought

211
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:33,240
the one opening the door would be

212
00:17:33,310 --> 00:17:34,510
a servant or maid.

213
00:17:34,640 --> 00:17:36,270
How did you find my house?

214
00:17:39,110 --> 00:17:40,590
Didn't the Chief ask Yan and the others

215
00:17:40,590 --> 00:17:41,790
to escort you back?

216
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:43,070
I asked them.

217
00:17:44,270 --> 00:17:45,350
No one in the bureau knows

218
00:17:45,350 --> 00:17:46,270
my address.

219
00:17:52,440 --> 00:17:53,270
I admit,

220
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:55,960
I followed you that day.

221
00:17:56,310 --> 00:17:57,830
With my lightness skill,

222
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:59,270
following you here

223
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,270
was a piece of cake.

224
00:18:07,270 --> 00:18:08,440
Didn't you say

225
00:18:09,090 --> 00:18:11,810
you've been homeless since you were 11

226
00:18:11,920 --> 00:18:13,380
and studied under Dao Yin?

227
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:14,830
I didn't expect

228
00:18:15,270 --> 00:18:17,070
that you'd own such an old house

229
00:18:17,350 --> 00:18:18,830
here in Tianhuang City.

230
00:18:19,310 --> 00:18:20,030
Why haven't I

231
00:18:20,030 --> 00:18:21,640
heard you mention it before?

232
00:18:22,030 --> 00:18:22,880
Or is it

233
00:18:23,830 --> 00:18:26,000
that this house is...

234
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:26,720
Meng Rui.

235
00:18:26,910 --> 00:18:28,520
Meng Rui! Meng Rui!

236
00:18:34,070 --> 00:18:36,550
My parents must be waiting for me!

237
00:18:36,550 --> 00:18:37,590
And my brother!

238
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:39,270
He must be anxiously waiting for me

239
00:18:39,270 --> 00:18:40,640
to fly kites together!

240
00:18:45,290 --> 00:18:47,440
Shen Jing'an, 11 years old.

241
00:18:48,550 --> 00:18:50,940
Shen Lan, 8 years old.

242
00:19:44,550 --> 00:19:45,350
Yan'er.

243
00:19:51,510 --> 00:19:53,440
So beautiful! It's awesome!

244
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:54,920
Awesome!

245
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:58,070
-Father made me a grasshopper!
-Slow down, Fourth Prince.

246
00:19:58,070 --> 00:20:00,350
Father made me a grasshopper!

247
00:20:00,350 --> 00:20:02,440
The grasshopper Father made me

248
00:20:02,550 --> 00:20:05,070
is the most beautiful in the world!

249
00:20:06,550 --> 00:20:07,350
Father,

250
00:20:07,350 --> 00:20:09,480
will you make more for me in the future?

251
00:20:09,790 --> 00:20:10,790
I will weave a hundred grasshoppers

252
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:12,440
for you, Yan'er.

253
00:20:12,750 --> 00:20:14,310
Why a hundred?

254
00:20:14,310 --> 00:20:17,590
Because I hope you

255
00:20:17,800 --> 00:20:19,460
can live a long life.

256
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:22,830
But Father,

257
00:20:23,100 --> 00:20:24,310
what would you do

258
00:20:24,310 --> 00:20:25,680
if I die

259
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:26,790
one day?

260
00:20:27,220 --> 00:20:28,150
Nonsense.

261
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:36,480
My Yan'er

262
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:38,480
will surely live a long life

263
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:40,530
and become the most outstanding emperor

264
00:20:40,530 --> 00:20:42,050
of our Great Shi Dynasty.

265
00:21:14,820 --> 00:21:18,030
[Shen]

266
00:21:21,750 --> 00:21:23,270
If you are Shen Lan,

267
00:21:24,110 --> 00:21:25,030
then I guess

268
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:30,160
your brother Shen Jing'an is still alive.

269
00:21:31,470 --> 00:21:32,750
Bearing a blood feud,

270
00:21:33,480 --> 00:21:34,790
he changed his name.

271
00:21:36,160 --> 00:21:38,240
Maybe he even became a constable.

272
00:21:50,350 --> 00:21:51,680
I'll make a bet with you.

273
00:21:54,010 --> 00:21:56,070
He must be waiting for you to come home

274
00:21:57,540 --> 00:21:59,150
to fly kites together.

275
00:22:26,440 --> 00:22:27,500
As the saying goes,

276
00:22:27,680 --> 00:22:30,030
it takes a hundred days
to recover from a bone injury.

277
00:22:30,030 --> 00:22:33,880
Not to mention your injury
is quite serious.

278
00:22:36,350 --> 00:22:38,270
Mr. Meng, in the future,

279
00:22:39,070 --> 00:22:41,000
we will be neighbors.

280
00:22:41,440 --> 00:22:42,440
You are welcome

281
00:22:43,270 --> 00:22:44,960
to visit me regularly.

282
00:22:45,640 --> 00:22:46,570
What did you say?

283
00:22:49,110 --> 00:22:50,070
This house...

284
00:22:50,830 --> 00:22:53,070
I bargained it down to 240 taels.

285
00:22:53,790 --> 00:22:55,680
They said that since I wanted
to move in overnight,

286
00:22:55,680 --> 00:22:57,280
I had to add another 10 taels.

287
00:22:57,790 --> 00:22:58,590
I don't know

288
00:22:58,590 --> 00:22:59,880
if spending these 250 taels of silver

289
00:22:59,880 --> 00:23:00,750
was considered

290
00:23:01,110 --> 00:23:02,110
expensive or not.

291
00:23:07,920 --> 00:23:09,050
I have a gift for you.

292
00:23:17,450 --> 00:23:19,580
Shen Lan, let's see

293
00:23:19,890 --> 00:23:21,050
who wins this bet.

294
00:23:21,080 --> 00:23:22,450
You, or me.

295
00:23:23,400 --> 00:23:24,760
I can only try.

296
00:23:34,710 --> 00:23:36,590
Brother, you're flying it so high.

297
00:23:36,590 --> 00:23:37,350
Brother,

298
00:23:37,350 --> 00:23:39,110
can you fly it a bit higher?

299
00:23:39,110 --> 00:23:39,920
Okay!

300
00:24:14,220 --> 00:24:15,250
It seems

301
00:24:16,480 --> 00:24:18,100
my guess was right.

302
00:24:18,500 --> 00:24:20,000
Shen Jing'an has never

303
00:24:20,000 --> 00:24:20,790
forgotten

304
00:24:21,400 --> 00:24:23,320
the promise with his brother.

305
00:24:26,790 --> 00:24:27,920
The deeper the love,

306
00:24:28,640 --> 00:24:30,110
the deeper the pain.

307
00:24:52,110 --> 00:24:52,920
Meng Rui,

308
00:24:54,640 --> 00:24:55,790
don't mind

309
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:57,000
the kite.

310
00:24:57,640 --> 00:24:59,640
I just wanted to give my new neighbor

311
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:00,790
a little gift.

312
00:25:05,350 --> 00:25:06,880
Let's get down to business.

313
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:08,590
I promised

314
00:25:08,960 --> 00:25:11,350
to tell you the situation
in the bureau.

315
00:25:12,030 --> 00:25:13,200
The case of the demon

316
00:25:13,400 --> 00:25:15,000
has made no progress so far.

317
00:25:15,550 --> 00:25:17,210
Lou Tianming's wanted poster

318
00:25:17,550 --> 00:25:20,160
has also been sent
to all prefectures and counties.

319
00:25:20,160 --> 00:25:21,490
You don't need to worry.

320
00:25:28,110 --> 00:25:28,920
By the way,

321
00:25:29,830 --> 00:25:31,090
there is one more thing

322
00:25:31,720 --> 00:25:34,310
that is crucial to the overall situation.

323
00:25:34,350 --> 00:25:37,000
Although the Chief repeatedly told me

324
00:25:37,160 --> 00:25:38,480
not to tell you yet,

325
00:25:38,750 --> 00:25:40,790
I think

326
00:25:42,310 --> 00:25:43,960
I should still let you know.

327
00:25:46,790 --> 00:25:47,590
Come in.

328
00:25:50,830 --> 00:25:51,720
When will you change your habit

329
00:25:51,720 --> 00:25:53,750
of always bringing up the Chief

330
00:25:53,960 --> 00:25:55,160
at every turn?

331
00:26:01,000 --> 00:26:02,350
What's on your back?

332
00:26:05,470 --> 00:26:07,330
The Kui Wood Wolf constellation.

333
00:26:07,590 --> 00:26:08,400
Ever since Dao Yin

334
00:26:08,400 --> 00:26:09,720
taught me the Severe-Cold Sword technique,

335
00:26:09,720 --> 00:26:10,750
I've had this.

336
00:26:11,310 --> 00:26:13,570
It appears whenever I channel my energy.

337
00:26:17,830 --> 00:26:19,440
I didn't expect this technique

338
00:26:19,440 --> 00:26:20,790
to be so profound.

339
00:26:22,310 --> 00:26:24,170
The Severe-Cold Sword technique

340
00:26:24,240 --> 00:26:25,700
is indeed extraordinary.

341
00:26:30,030 --> 00:26:31,160
You and Dao Yin...

342
00:26:31,790 --> 00:26:32,960
A beggar

343
00:26:33,160 --> 00:26:34,200
and a wanderer

344
00:26:35,160 --> 00:26:36,400
actually developed

345
00:26:36,750 --> 00:26:38,510
such a master-disciple bond.

346
00:26:39,120 --> 00:26:40,800
What a deep destiny.

347
00:26:49,510 --> 00:26:50,310
Meng Rui,

348
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:52,610
why did you

349
00:26:52,640 --> 00:26:54,400
want to learn the
Severe-Cold Sword technique?

350
00:26:54,400 --> 00:26:55,260
Could it be that

351
00:26:56,200 --> 00:26:58,060
you have some deep-seated hatred

352
00:26:58,350 --> 00:26:59,750
and need peerless martial arts

353
00:26:59,750 --> 00:27:01,160
to take revenge?

354
00:27:20,200 --> 00:27:21,350
Nice drawing.

355
00:27:23,350 --> 00:27:24,750
But what is this you drew?

356
00:27:25,750 --> 00:27:27,400
This is the tattoo I saw

357
00:27:27,590 --> 00:27:28,720
on the demon's nape.

358
00:27:29,720 --> 00:27:30,510
Since

359
00:27:31,350 --> 00:27:33,350
they tattooed it on their bodies,

360
00:27:33,750 --> 00:27:34,720
it means

361
00:27:35,720 --> 00:27:36,920
this thing is crucial

362
00:27:37,350 --> 00:27:39,400
to them.

363
00:27:43,270 --> 00:27:44,070
Meng Rui,

364
00:27:45,640 --> 00:27:47,170
have you ever thought about

365
00:27:47,550 --> 00:27:48,240
investigating

366
00:27:48,240 --> 00:27:49,720
the origin of this bug?

367
00:27:49,960 --> 00:27:50,960
I was just planning

368
00:27:50,960 --> 00:27:53,560
to go to Tianshu Pavilion
to check it out later.

369
00:27:56,000 --> 00:27:58,350
Why would Tianshu Pavilion
know anything about this?

370
00:27:58,350 --> 00:28:00,330
For weird things like this,

371
00:28:00,550 --> 00:28:02,590
you have to rely on unorthodox methods

372
00:28:02,590 --> 00:28:03,480
to ask around.

373
00:28:08,750 --> 00:28:09,880
Are you interested?

374
00:28:10,310 --> 00:28:11,680
I'll take you to a place

375
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:13,400
to help you investigate.

376
00:28:22,000 --> 00:28:23,730
This is the Underworld Market?

377
00:28:24,680 --> 00:28:25,480
That's right.

378
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:28,040
This is the largest black market

379
00:28:28,140 --> 00:28:29,680
in Great Shi.

380
00:28:30,830 --> 00:28:32,750
The Divine Constable Bureau
has tried to raid it many times,

381
00:28:32,750 --> 00:28:34,350
but could never find a way in.

382
00:28:36,590 --> 00:28:39,030
I remember when you first joined
the Divine Constable Bureau,

383
00:28:39,030 --> 00:28:41,960
you arrested many merchants
from the Underworld Market.

384
00:28:41,960 --> 00:28:44,360
What is your relationship with this place?

385
00:28:44,960 --> 00:28:46,220
Lord Constable Ghost,

386
00:28:46,790 --> 00:28:47,920
don't forget.

387
00:28:48,350 --> 00:28:49,880
Besides being a constable,

388
00:28:50,240 --> 00:28:51,720
I am also a merchant.

389
00:28:52,400 --> 00:28:53,550
As a merchant,

390
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:55,030
it's natural to have some

391
00:28:55,030 --> 00:28:56,200
connections.

392
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:58,900
It's not surprising that I have dealings

393
00:28:59,350 --> 00:29:00,950
with the Underworld Market.

394
00:29:01,000 --> 00:29:01,830
Let's go.

395
00:29:19,920 --> 00:29:21,050
Why are you running?

396
00:29:22,110 --> 00:29:23,000
Don't worry.

397
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:24,880
The one who came here today

398
00:29:24,880 --> 00:29:26,350
is not Lord Constable Ghost,

399
00:29:26,350 --> 00:29:27,310
but my friend.

400
00:29:29,480 --> 00:29:30,750
We are here to ask you

401
00:29:30,880 --> 00:29:32,310
about something.

402
00:29:34,960 --> 00:29:36,000
I really don't know

403
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:37,480
where your master is.

404
00:29:46,160 --> 00:29:47,920
Have you seen this?

405
00:29:52,330 --> 00:29:53,390
The usual rules.

406
00:29:57,510 --> 00:29:58,370
Is that enough?

407
00:29:58,640 --> 00:30:00,240
Tell us everything you know.

408
00:30:04,750 --> 00:30:05,640
Mr. Meng...

409
00:30:08,240 --> 00:30:11,290
Have you ever heard of
the Five Wonders of Liluo?

410
00:30:11,670 --> 00:30:13,130
The Five Wonders of Liluo?

411
00:30:14,630 --> 00:30:16,710
This insect is called Chiying,

412
00:30:16,830 --> 00:30:19,240
one of the Five Wonders of Liluo.

413
00:30:19,650 --> 00:30:21,200
In our line of work,

414
00:30:21,310 --> 00:30:24,110
we often have to search around for

415
00:30:24,310 --> 00:30:28,370
snakes, insects, and poisonous plants
to use as medicinal ingredients.

416
00:30:28,790 --> 00:30:29,590
Rumor has it

417
00:30:30,410 --> 00:30:31,280
that Chiying

418
00:30:31,310 --> 00:30:33,510
loves to gather around graves.

419
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:36,000
Someone once saw it

420
00:30:36,680 --> 00:30:38,010
while gathering herbs.

421
00:30:38,160 --> 00:30:38,960
Where?

422
00:30:39,830 --> 00:30:40,920
Where?

423
00:30:41,830 --> 00:30:43,310
When people get old,

424
00:30:44,110 --> 00:30:45,710
they really become useless.

425
00:30:47,310 --> 00:30:48,240
Useless...

426
00:30:50,160 --> 00:30:50,960
Speak.

427
00:30:57,720 --> 00:30:58,880
I remember now.

428
00:31:00,240 --> 00:31:03,720
It was found in Mingling County, Qingzhou.

429
00:31:03,960 --> 00:31:04,920
There's one person here

430
00:31:04,920 --> 00:31:05,920
who isn't marked.

431
00:31:05,930 --> 00:31:07,940
[Ministry of War Roster] [Su Wei]

432
00:31:06,310 --> 00:31:08,170
Could this person still be alive?

433
00:31:08,270 --> 00:31:09,240
This person

434
00:31:09,240 --> 00:31:11,110
went to Mingling County in Qingzhou
many years ago

435
00:31:11,110 --> 00:31:12,970
and disappeared without a trace.

436
00:31:13,070 --> 00:31:14,110
This Chiying insect

437
00:31:14,110 --> 00:31:15,790
is no ordinary bug.

438
00:31:16,110 --> 00:31:18,560
Anyone who sees it is terrified.

439
00:31:18,880 --> 00:31:19,680
However,

440
00:31:20,110 --> 00:31:22,440
that's all in the past.

441
00:31:22,720 --> 00:31:23,880
Later on,

442
00:31:23,880 --> 00:31:25,440
it disappeared completely.

443
00:31:25,440 --> 00:31:27,110
Since it is one of
the Five Wonders of Liluo,

444
00:31:27,110 --> 00:31:28,370
what makes it a wonder?

445
00:31:29,640 --> 00:31:31,440
Its wonder lies in its poison.

446
00:31:32,030 --> 00:31:33,550
If a hundred of them bite the body

447
00:31:33,550 --> 00:31:34,830
and the poison enters the marrow,

448
00:31:34,830 --> 00:31:36,880
it can turn a person into a demon.

449
00:31:37,350 --> 00:31:38,610
The poisoned person's

450
00:31:38,640 --> 00:31:41,240
physical capabilities
will increase severalfold,

451
00:31:41,240 --> 00:31:42,900
with a body of the netherworld

452
00:31:43,110 --> 00:31:44,720
and the soul of a beast.

453
00:31:45,960 --> 00:31:47,070
In that case,

454
00:31:47,920 --> 00:31:49,720
Liluo's Dark Night is using this method

455
00:31:49,720 --> 00:31:51,750
to turn living people
into demonic suicide squads

456
00:31:51,750 --> 00:31:52,830
for its use.

457
00:31:53,480 --> 00:31:54,480
No wonder those demons

458
00:31:54,480 --> 00:31:56,000
were impossible to kill.

459
00:31:56,550 --> 00:31:58,590
Their bodies have mutated.

460
00:31:59,110 --> 00:32:00,510
Half human, half demon.

461
00:32:01,240 --> 00:32:02,920
What an evil practice.

462
00:32:05,960 --> 00:32:07,000
You mentioned

463
00:32:07,440 --> 00:32:08,900
the Five Wonders of Liluo.

464
00:32:09,240 --> 00:32:10,700
Besides the Chiying bugs,

465
00:32:11,160 --> 00:32:12,690
what are the other wonders?

466
00:32:13,240 --> 00:32:14,770
You asked the right person.

467
00:32:18,160 --> 00:32:19,290
Trying to snatch it?

468
00:32:21,440 --> 00:32:22,240
Speak.

469
00:32:23,240 --> 00:32:24,640
Chiying bugs light the fire,

470
00:32:24,640 --> 00:32:26,400
eroding bones to spawn demons.

471
00:32:27,240 --> 00:32:28,240
The Chiying bugs.

472
00:32:28,730 --> 00:32:30,030
Luo flowers condense into jade,

473
00:32:30,030 --> 00:32:31,830
turning white hair black again.

474
00:32:32,070 --> 00:32:34,400
Tianmoluo, the fruit of immortality.

475
00:32:35,310 --> 00:32:36,880
Puppets pulled by moss threads,

476
00:32:36,880 --> 00:32:38,680
having neither tears nor heart.

477
00:32:40,510 --> 00:32:41,510
Puppetry.

478
00:32:42,030 --> 00:32:43,680
The moon's reflection
turns into the flower in the mirror,

479
00:32:43,680 --> 00:32:45,510
replacing old bones with new faces.

480
00:32:45,510 --> 00:32:46,960
The Canglang tide boils,

481
00:32:46,960 --> 00:32:49,420
and the Eight Wastelands breathe together.

482
00:32:52,640 --> 00:32:53,880
What are these two?

483
00:32:53,900 --> 00:32:55,450
I don't know about that.

484
00:32:55,510 --> 00:32:56,860
That's all

485
00:32:56,930 --> 00:32:58,190
I know.

486
00:33:00,750 --> 00:33:02,610
Liluo actually has 5 ultimate secret arts.

487
00:33:02,610 --> 00:33:03,920
They're carefully planning

488
00:33:03,920 --> 00:33:06,380
to use these evil arts
to revive their reign.

489
00:33:06,550 --> 00:33:07,810
Great Shi is in danger.

490
00:33:07,880 --> 00:33:10,110
You are quite concerned about
the country and the people.

491
00:33:10,110 --> 00:33:11,680
I thought Lord Constable Ghost

492
00:33:11,680 --> 00:33:14,280
only cared about
catching and killing people.

493
00:33:14,510 --> 00:33:15,310
Don't worry.

494
00:33:15,550 --> 00:33:16,110
If we can

495
00:33:16,110 --> 00:33:17,840
get a hold of this information,

496
00:33:17,930 --> 00:33:20,450
the Chief and the one on the dragon throne

497
00:33:20,490 --> 00:33:21,820
must have found out too.

498
00:33:29,030 --> 00:33:30,030
It's just that...

499
00:33:30,550 --> 00:33:33,080
We are in the open,
and the enemy is in the dark.

500
00:33:33,750 --> 00:33:34,880
It's hard for us to find

501
00:33:34,880 --> 00:33:36,110
their traces.

502
00:33:36,510 --> 00:33:38,160
How would we know if we don't try?

503
00:33:38,160 --> 00:33:39,070
Well said.

504
00:33:39,750 --> 00:33:41,810
As expected of Lord Constable Ghost.

505
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:43,510
Old Geezer said

506
00:33:43,510 --> 00:33:45,640
the last place the Chiying bugs appeared

507
00:33:45,640 --> 00:33:47,440
was Mingling County, Qingzhou.

508
00:33:47,650 --> 00:33:48,450
How about it?

509
00:33:48,750 --> 00:33:49,880
Are you interested

510
00:33:50,000 --> 00:33:51,200
in going together?

511
00:33:58,920 --> 00:34:01,380
You're not thinking
of going alone, are you?

512
00:34:02,000 --> 00:34:02,680
If I take you,

513
00:34:02,680 --> 00:34:03,920
I have to ask the Chief for orders

514
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:05,270
and treat it as official business.

515
00:34:05,270 --> 00:34:06,750
I haven't recovered from my injuries yet.

516
00:34:06,750 --> 00:34:08,670
Do you think the Chief would agree?

517
00:34:08,670 --> 00:34:09,840
Let me tell you,

518
00:34:09,960 --> 00:34:11,510
if you don't take me,

519
00:34:11,750 --> 00:34:13,630
I'll report to the Chief

520
00:34:13,710 --> 00:34:15,300
that you are investigating privately

521
00:34:15,300 --> 00:34:16,480
and acting without authorization.

522
00:34:16,480 --> 00:34:17,540
When that happens,

523
00:34:17,710 --> 00:34:18,880
the Chief will never

524
00:34:18,880 --> 00:34:20,190
dispatch you there.

525
00:34:20,230 --> 00:34:21,320
Think it through.

526
00:34:24,469 --> 00:34:25,550
Su Wei...

527
00:34:30,510 --> 00:34:31,360
Li Qingyang!

528
00:34:32,949 --> 00:34:35,150
[Star-Gathering Pavilion]

529
00:34:41,770 --> 00:34:43,260
[Ministry of War Roster] [Su Wei]

530
00:34:56,150 --> 00:34:58,480
Going to Mingling County to find someone?

531
00:34:59,480 --> 00:35:01,610
I thought you were going to catch bugs.

532
00:35:04,670 --> 00:35:05,760
In a sea of people,

533
00:35:05,960 --> 00:35:08,510
do you think it's easier to find a person

534
00:35:08,880 --> 00:35:10,320
or a bug?

535
00:35:10,320 --> 00:35:11,150
Save it.

536
00:35:12,150 --> 00:35:14,350
With your current physical condition,

537
00:35:14,360 --> 00:35:17,490
it's a question whether
you'll even survive the search.

538
00:35:20,550 --> 00:35:21,360
Tell me,

539
00:35:22,670 --> 00:35:23,630
even if

540
00:35:24,360 --> 00:35:25,510
I find this Su Wei

541
00:35:25,510 --> 00:35:26,360
from back then

542
00:35:26,710 --> 00:35:29,440
and force him to tell everything
about what happened,

543
00:35:29,440 --> 00:35:30,230
will Father

544
00:35:31,280 --> 00:35:32,880
release my eldest brother?

545
00:35:34,670 --> 00:35:35,530
My disciple...

546
00:35:36,510 --> 00:35:37,400
Actually, you already

547
00:35:37,400 --> 00:35:38,670
know the answer,

548
00:35:39,510 --> 00:35:40,360
don't you?

549
00:35:46,150 --> 00:35:47,750
You already know the answer.

550
00:35:53,110 --> 00:35:55,050
[Su Wei]

551
00:35:55,610 --> 00:35:57,280
[Divine Constable Bureau]

552
00:35:56,000 --> 00:35:57,510
In Mingling County, Qingzhou,

553
00:35:57,510 --> 00:36:00,320
a green-haired demon suddenly appeared
on Mount Fuyao.

554
00:36:00,320 --> 00:36:02,570
Its appearance is terrifying,
and its movements are mysterious.

555
00:36:02,570 --> 00:36:03,880
It digs up graves, unearths corpses,

556
00:36:03,880 --> 00:36:05,610
picks bones, and eats carrion.

557
00:36:06,920 --> 00:36:08,120
Green-haired demon.

558
00:36:09,110 --> 00:36:10,510
The magistrate of Mingling County

559
00:36:10,510 --> 00:36:12,070
is quite good at naming things.

560
00:36:12,070 --> 00:36:12,630
Previously,

561
00:36:12,630 --> 00:36:14,510
similar cases had been reported.

562
00:36:14,880 --> 00:36:16,030
They were mostly

563
00:36:16,030 --> 00:36:17,150
baseless rumors

564
00:36:17,280 --> 00:36:18,440
and nonsense from people

565
00:36:18,440 --> 00:36:19,640
scaring themselves.

566
00:36:19,970 --> 00:36:20,960
Let the local officials

567
00:36:20,960 --> 00:36:22,360
investigate it further.

568
00:36:25,320 --> 00:36:26,280
Chief,

569
00:36:26,510 --> 00:36:27,920
please look closely.

570
00:36:28,110 --> 00:36:29,960
This case is very uncanny

571
00:36:30,070 --> 00:36:31,470
and by no means ordinary.

572
00:36:31,590 --> 00:36:32,990
What's uncanny about it?

573
00:36:33,110 --> 00:36:34,710
A demon with green hair?

574
00:36:42,860 --> 00:36:44,190
Reporting to the Chief,

575
00:36:44,760 --> 00:36:46,760
I asked Constable Li

576
00:36:46,760 --> 00:36:47,960
to bring up this case.

577
00:36:48,480 --> 00:36:51,340
But investigating the case
is not the main purpose.

578
00:36:51,670 --> 00:36:52,670
Then what is it?

579
00:36:53,070 --> 00:36:53,880
It's...

580
00:36:55,840 --> 00:36:56,840
To recuperate.

581
00:36:58,760 --> 00:37:00,090
You may not know, Chief.

582
00:37:00,400 --> 00:37:01,920
Since I was injured,

583
00:37:02,470 --> 00:37:04,320
I've been deeply troubled and restless.

584
00:37:04,320 --> 00:37:05,250
Mingling County

585
00:37:05,400 --> 00:37:07,070
is my ancestral home.

586
00:37:07,280 --> 00:37:09,150
For some reason, I suddenly...

587
00:37:10,550 --> 00:37:12,790
felt a bit homesick.

588
00:37:14,150 --> 00:37:15,320
I didn't know that.

589
00:37:16,110 --> 00:37:18,570
In that case,
your health takes precedence.

590
00:37:18,670 --> 00:37:19,760
Take your time there.

591
00:37:19,760 --> 00:37:20,890
Relax and rest well.

592
00:37:21,480 --> 00:37:23,210
As for the green-haired demon,

593
00:37:23,760 --> 00:37:25,560
leave it to the local officials.

594
00:37:26,000 --> 00:37:27,000
Thank you, Chief.

595
00:37:28,320 --> 00:37:29,510
Then I'll go too.

596
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:32,110
Li Qingyang.

597
00:37:32,880 --> 00:37:33,550
Yes.

598
00:37:33,550 --> 00:37:34,510
Recently, the Ministry of Justice

599
00:37:34,510 --> 00:37:36,550
is going to shut down
some underground banks.

600
00:37:36,550 --> 00:37:38,070
Assist them on the side.

601
00:37:38,360 --> 00:37:39,480
You don't need to take the lead,

602
00:37:39,480 --> 00:37:40,810
but you need to be there.

603
00:37:40,960 --> 00:37:42,000
As a newly appointed Divine Constable,

604
00:37:42,000 --> 00:37:42,800
this task

605
00:37:42,800 --> 00:37:44,280
is perfect for you.

606
00:37:44,400 --> 00:37:44,960
But...

607
00:37:44,960 --> 00:37:45,960
It's settled.

608
00:37:46,190 --> 00:37:47,110
You may all leave.

609
00:37:47,110 --> 00:37:48,150
Chief...

610
00:37:55,000 --> 00:37:56,000
Chief.

611
00:37:56,000 --> 00:37:57,360
Constable Ghost
hasn't fully recovered yet.

612
00:37:57,360 --> 00:37:58,510
I am willing to accompany him

613
00:37:58,510 --> 00:38:00,170
to facilitate his treatment.

614
00:38:01,710 --> 00:38:02,510
Alright.

615
00:38:06,710 --> 00:38:07,510
Who else?

616
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:09,400
Come in and say it all at once.

617
00:38:13,510 --> 00:38:14,510
Chief.

618
00:38:14,760 --> 00:38:15,550
What is it?

619
00:38:15,880 --> 00:38:17,280
Have you forgotten, Chief?

620
00:38:17,280 --> 00:38:18,960
While Mr. Meng has been recovering,

621
00:38:18,960 --> 00:38:19,920
all the fieldwork cases

622
00:38:19,920 --> 00:38:21,320
have fallen on me alone.

623
00:38:21,320 --> 00:38:22,440
Didn't you promise

624
00:38:22,590 --> 00:38:23,880
that after this matter,

625
00:38:23,880 --> 00:38:25,610
you would give me some time off?

626
00:38:27,510 --> 00:38:28,880
That is true.

627
00:38:28,880 --> 00:38:30,210
I forgot when I got busy.

628
00:38:30,360 --> 00:38:32,510
Then I grant you half a month's leave.

629
00:38:33,190 --> 00:38:34,480
Thank you, Chief.

630
00:38:47,760 --> 00:38:49,360
So I'm the only one left.

631
00:40:00,760 --> 00:40:03,890
Congratulations on your
successful mutation, My Lord.

632
00:40:06,360 --> 00:40:07,760
What about the others?

633
00:40:07,970 --> 00:40:09,360
My Lord, your talent is extraordinary.

634
00:40:09,360 --> 00:40:10,800
How can mere people compare?

635
00:40:10,800 --> 00:40:12,920
The current success rate
is less than ten percent.

636
00:40:12,920 --> 00:40:14,880
And even those who have mutated

637
00:40:14,880 --> 00:40:16,280
may experience

638
00:40:16,360 --> 00:40:17,480
sudden death.

639
00:40:20,760 --> 00:40:22,480
Go capture more people...

640
00:40:25,580 --> 00:40:27,230
Go capture more people.

641
00:40:27,710 --> 00:40:28,850
I want people.

642
00:40:29,320 --> 00:40:30,360
I want demons!

643
00:40:30,880 --> 00:40:32,960
Only a sufficiently powerful army

644
00:40:33,360 --> 00:40:35,360
can be invincible!

645
00:40:36,550 --> 00:40:37,360
Yes.
